8
00:03:06,500 --> 00:03:09,600
答えを永遠と探し続けて
Endlessly searching for an answer,

9
00:03:09,600 --> 00:03:12,700
何者かになりたくて
wishing to become somebody,

10
00:03:12,700 --> 00:03:15,100
燦々と降る夕立を
I merely gazed at

11
00:03:15,100 --> 00:03:18,000
ただ眺めた
the heavily falling evening shower.

12
00:03:18,000 --> 00:03:20,500
優しく寄り添って
Gently nestling close,

13
00:03:20,500 --> 00:03:23,100
心が晴れるのなら
