しどけないくらい クラクラしちゃう 心惑わすから
I feel dizzy to the point of helplessness, confusing my heart...

135
00:13:02,129 --> 00:13:04,929
あなただけ 君だけ
Only you, only you,

136
00:13:04,929 --> 00:13:10,629
夜に散らかして 駆ける
scattered across the night, we run.

137
00:13:11,129 --> 00:13:17,129
見つめあうあなたの表情 照らして 明星ギャラクティカ
Illuminating your expression as we gaze at each other, Venus Galactica.

138
00:13:17,329 --> 00:13:24,129
見上げた夜空の彼方 宇宙は散らばって光る
Far across the night sky we look up at, the universe scatters and shines.

139
00:13:24,329 --> 00:13:29,129
プカプカ踊り踊って 孤独ごと消し去って
Dancing floatingly, erasing even our loneliness,

140
00:13:29,129 --> 00:13:34,129
