Ah, swimming out at the same pace in the basement, a shallow, one-time dance joining dusk to dusk.

143
00:13:55,329 --> 00:14:00,329
あなたとわたしの旅立つ星の行方は 何光年先を探した
Where is the star we're journeying to? We searched light-years ahead.

144
00:14:00,629 --> 00:14:07,129
結ぶオリオンの赤い星 真っ赤に燃えるから
The red star connecting Orion burns so brightly red...

145
00:14:07,329 --> 00:14:15,129
今夜だけ 君だけ 踊りましょう 夜はあんまりの寂漠だから
Just for tonight, just with you, let's dance, because the night is far too lonely.

146
00:14:16,129 --> 00:14:22,129
見つめあうあなたの表情 隠して 明星ギャラクティカ
Hiding your expression as we gaze at each other, Venus Galactica.

147
00:14:22,329 --> 00:14:29,129
そわつく危険な気持ちが 満ちだして探りあうから
As this restless, dangerous feeling swells and we probe each other...

148
00:14:29,329 --> 00:14:34,329
生まれたままの衝動 隠して 明星ギャラクティカ
Hiding our raw, natural impulses, Venus Galactica.

149
00:14:34,329 --> 00:14:40,329
あなたと言葉が 解けて 解ける
You and words melt and dissolve...

150
